 "remarks": "Soak up the vibes of downtown Stamford on your private front porch! This modern & unique, Victorian tri-level townhome offered in immaculate condition features a bright open flow with hardwood floors and cheerful sunny space. The main level offers a living room, pretty updated kitchen & window lined dining area! Adding to the modern space is the lower level offering additional flexible space accented with a warm, cozy fireplace. Upstairs, two generous sun-filled bedrooms and full bath complete the sleeping level, third floor living space w/ walk-in closet. Live the urban dream, in the pulse of sophisticated downtown where your steps to popular shops, restaurants, theaters, transportation and all major routes. Private parking adds to the ease of living here. Move in, unpack and enjoy life!",
